<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '60px 60px', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>一台会说话、会看、会动手的终端</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', letterSpacing: 1 }}>01 / 产品与形态</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, marginTop: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', width: 556 }}>
            <Image src="assets/device_front.jpg" style={{ width: 556, height: 418, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 8 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 12 }}>
                真机实拍：ESP32-S31-Korvo-1，4.3 英寸 800×480 触摸屏，屏幕上方为摄像头与麦克风
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{
            width: 572,
            padding: '18px 22px',
            border: '1px solid #E2E8F0',
            borderRadius: 8,
            display: 'flex',
            flexDirection: 'column',
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', marginBottom: 4 }}>硬件规格</Text>

            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', height: 56, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #F1F5F9' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', width: 108 }}>主控</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B' }}>ESP32-S31 · RISC-V @ 240 MHz</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', height: 56, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #F1F5F9' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', width: 108 }}>内存</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B' }}>16 MB Flash + 8 MB PSRAM（OCT 200 MHz）</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', height: 56, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #F1F5F9' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', width: 108 }}>显示</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B' }}>800×480 RGB 屏 · 双帧缓冲 · 电容触摸</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', height: 56, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #F1F5F9' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', width: 108 }}>摄像头</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B' }}>OV3660（DVP）1280×720 JPEG / 240×240 RGB</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', height: 56, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #F1F5F9' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', width: 108 }}>音频</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B' }}>ES8389 Codec · 录音 16 kHz / 播放 16 kHz 立体声</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', height: 56, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', width: 108 }}>存储</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B' }}>microSD（FATFS）· 曲库 / 照片 / 壁纸 / 人脸库</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{
        display: 'flex',
        flexDirection: 'row',
        alignItems: 'center',
        marginTop: 26,
        padding: '16px 22px',
        background: '#EFF6FF',
        borderRadius: 8,
        borderLeft: '3px solid #2563EB',
    }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            屏幕、镜头、麦克风都在设备上 —— 形态决定了它必须<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>「在场」</span>：
            感知与执行留在本地，判断交给云端。
        </Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
